    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16498" root="ركز" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاكِزٌ</span></b>  A thing that is <i>firm,</i> or <i>fixed.</i> (Mgh.)
[Hence,] one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِزُّهُمْ رَاكِزٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Their might,</i> or
<i>glory, is firmly established.</i> (A, TA.)

